# PREIShare Project Rules

- Use TypeScript, React, TanStack Start/Router, Vite, and Tailwind CSS.
- Follow the existing structure in `src/`.
- Routes belong in `src/routes/`.
- Reusable UI components belong in `src/components/`.
- Use the existing styles and conventions in `src/styles.css`.
- Do not edit `src/routeTree.gen.ts` manually because it is generated.
- Do not invent files, folders, npm scripts, or backend services that are not in the repository.
- Check `docs/onboarding/repo-map.md` before assuming project structure.
- Never put secrets, API keys, or `.env` contents in project files.
- Make small, focused changes and review them before committing.
- Follow the instructions in `AGENTS.md` when using AI-assisted development.